# THE JAILBREAK: every step is a turn, then every guard takes its turn.
# Steps go only the four straight ways. Crates push like a block puzzle.
# A guard sees straight along the way it faces (crates and other guards
# block it). Seen, it lines up its gun (one turn) and fires on its next
# turn, at whatever stands first in that line by then: step out of it and
# the shot goes by. Bumping a wall is no turn at all. The guards shoot
# indiscriminately: one lined up on the bat hits the guard that walks in
# between.
seed 1
game echounit
wait 5
cheat rescue 1 3 5
cheat rblank
wait 2
expect mode == 5
expect r_owl == 3
expect r_hp == 2
# a crate pushed along
cheat rtile 4 4 111
press RIGHT 1
wait 1
press RIGHT 1
wait 1
expect r_x == 4
expect r_turns == 2
expect r_tile_5_4 == 111
# into the wall: no turn
cheat rpos 1 1
press UP 1
wait 1
expect r_turns == 2
expect r_tile_5_4 == 111
# two ways at once: still one straight step, never a slant
cheat rpos 2 6
press RIGHT DOWN 1
wait 1
expect r_turns == 3
expect r_x == 2
expect r_y == 7
# a sentry looking along row 1 sees the bat step in: it aims, one turn
cheat rblank
cheat rguard 0 8 1 2
cheat rpos 1 2
press UP 1
wait 1
expect r_aiming == 1
expect r_gshots == 0
# out of the line before it fires: the shot goes by
press DOWN 1
wait 1
expect r_gshots == 1
expect r_hp == 2
# back in: it lines up again, and this time she stays: hit
press UP 1
wait 1
expect r_aiming == 1
press RIGHT 1
wait 1
expect r_gshots == 2
expect r_hp == 1
# indiscriminate: the guard lined up on Flint fires into its friend
cheat rescue 1 0 5
cheat rblank
cheat rguard 1 6 2 1
cheat rguard 0 10 4 2
press B 1
wait 1
expect r_aiming == 1
press UP 1
wait 1
expect r_gshots == 1
expect r_ff == 1
expect r_guards == 1
expect r_hp == 3
